# Server secret used to derive the Daily Challenge seed (HMAC-SHA256 with
# the challenge date). Required to serve/score the Daily Challenge; not
# needed for anything else. Keep it secret — anyone who has it (and knows
# the date) could predict that day's question set in advance.
DAILY_CHALLENGE_SEED_SECRET=
